    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37863" root="لفث" body-key="l">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلفث مَا عِنْدَهُ</span></b>  <i>He elicited, and exhausted,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِسْتَنْبَطَ وَٱسْتَقْصَى</span>,) <i>what</i> [information, &amp;c.] <i>he
had,</i> or <i>possessed.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلفث الرِّعْىَ</span> <i>He
consumed the whole of the pasture, leaving nothing of it.</i> (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلفث حَاجَتَهُ</span> <i>He
accomplished his want.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلفث الخَبَرَ</span>
<i>He concealed the news.</i> (K.)

